WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:05.400
Coding Exercise 2 combines text normalization and
fallback logic Do not use

00:00:05.412 --> 00:00:08.712
COALESCE directly on the raw email field because an
empty string or

00:00:08.738 --> 00:00:14.125
whitespace-only string is not NULL Normalize each
contact field first with BTRIM

00:00:14.150 --> 00:00:18.962
and NULLIF Then use COALESCE in the requested
priority order email mobile

00:00:18.988 --> 00:00:24.262
phone home phone and finally No contact provided
After running inspect the

00:00:24.275 --> 00:00:29.588
edge cases Robert Lee should fall back to home phone
Lisa Ray

00:00:29.612 --> 00:00:33.900
should also use home phone Maria Torres should use
mobile because the

00:00:33.925 --> 00:00:39.362
email contains only spaces Andre Green should
receive the final fallback text
